      <title>英国上议院议员质询网络安全法案为何不追究高管个人责任</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260907/%E8%8B%B1%E5%9B%BD%E4%B8%8A%E8%AE%AE%E9%99%A2%E8%AE%AE%E5%91%98%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%A2%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%B3%95%E6%A1%88%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%BD%E7%A9%B6%E9%AB%98%E7%AE%A1%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB/</link>
